1
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,380
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,760
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,287 --> 00:00:30,640
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:35,360
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,513 --> 00:00:39,040
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:39,933 --> 00:00:42,720
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:48,400
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:55,604
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,604 --> 00:00:58,123
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,123 --> 00:00:59,553
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:04,120
=Episode 16=

12
00:01:06,159 --> 00:01:07,560
Tomorrow's the day

13
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:09,480
we deal with the refugees who strayed
onto our land again, right?

14
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,120
Throw this woman

15
00:01:11,599 --> 00:01:13,400
into the soldiers' game,

16
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:16,560
right in the middle of the prey.

17
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:17,200
Understood.

18
00:01:17,879 --> 00:01:18,719
Wait, Feng Qingyun,

19
00:01:18,719 --> 00:01:20,040
what do you mean by this?

20
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:25,400
Hey, explain yourself!

21
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:29,959
Feng Qingyun is really twisted.

22
00:01:31,879 --> 00:01:34,680
And I don't know what's wrong with
this darn bracelet.

23
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:39,879
Is finding the wormhole tomorrow
really my only shot?

24
00:01:39,879 --> 00:01:41,599
Boss!

25
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,560
Is that you, boss?

26
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,159
It's you, Ye?

27
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:50,680
How come even in jail
we end up together?

28
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,519
Boss, it really is you!

29
00:01:52,519 --> 00:01:55,560
I never thought I'd live to see you
again.

30
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,959
- I thought I was going to die in here.
- That's enough.

31
00:01:56,959 --> 00:01:57,920
Just get to the point.

32
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,000
Hmm? What is it?

33
00:02:00,239 --> 00:02:00,840
It's a hoax.

34
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,359
That space wormhole is a total hoax.

35
00:02:03,719 --> 00:02:04,319
You know what?

36
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,359
We followed the rumors
and walked right into it.

37
00:02:06,359 --> 00:02:09,439
We stumbled into
a rebel army's private stronghold.

38
00:02:09,719 --> 00:02:11,599
A rebel army's private stronghold?

39
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:12,000
Exactly.

40
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:13,479
Boss, you still don't get it.

41
00:02:13,719 --> 00:02:15,280
Hang on, let me come over.

42
00:02:16,039 --> 00:02:17,400
Boss, listen.

43
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:20,400
That Kugu Ridge man-eating case
we got caught up in?

44
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,599
They're the ones who put the story out.

45
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:23,759
Don't bother.

46
00:02:23,759 --> 00:02:24,960
You're heavier than me.
You won't fit through.

47
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,919
Hey, you're the heavy one.

48
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,680
You got off track. Where were you?

49
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:31,400
They're the ones who put out
the Kugu Ridge man-eating story.

50
00:02:32,879 --> 00:02:34,240
Hold on. Let me sort this out.

51
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:37,639
So Mo Xuanji is planning a rebellion.

52
00:02:38,199 --> 00:02:39,919
That's why she rides roughshod
over the court,

53
00:02:39,919 --> 00:02:41,439
rakes in money through the waterways,

54
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:45,599
and secretly ships weapons

55
00:02:45,599 --> 00:02:47,879
to Yunlu City to raise a private army.

56
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:51,840
Du Wei defected five years ago.

57
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:53,199
The court never caught him.

58
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:56,360
Because Mo Xuanji protected him

59
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,840
and hid him here in Yunlu City.

60
00:02:59,039 --> 00:03:01,719
The private army is deep
in the mountains of Kugu Ridge.

61
00:03:01,719 --> 00:03:02,960
No outsider can know about it.

62
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,879
So they made up
the man-eating legend of Kugu Ridge.

63
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,439
That's right, boss.

64
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:11,120
And trying to get home,
the two of us idiots

65
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,239
didn't ask any questions

66
00:03:12,239 --> 00:03:13,639
and walked straight in, right?

67
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:14,879
Exactly.

68
00:03:14,879 --> 00:03:15,360
Exactly my ass.

69
00:03:15,879 --> 00:03:16,960
Me getting caught, that I understand.

70
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:17,840
But you're a martial arts master.

71
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:18,639
What are you doing in here?

72
00:03:18,639 --> 00:03:20,800
- I...
- You...

73
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,520
Wait.

74
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:22,639
Here's the thing, boss.

75
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:25,080
The body I inherited
must have trained in martial arts

76
00:03:25,199 --> 00:03:26,240
until something went wrong.

77
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:27,520
But the sad part is,

78
00:03:27,759 --> 00:03:29,879
this man loses all his power
five days a month

79
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:32,240
and becomes an ordinary old man.

80
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,520
The only reason I got here before you

81
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:34,560
is that I happened to lose all my power.

82
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,080
What kind of nonsense is that?

83
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,280
Oh, right.

84
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:40,639
What did Feng Qingyun mean

85
00:03:40,639 --> 00:03:41,719
about the soldiers' game?

86
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:42,719
Those soldiers

87
00:03:42,879 --> 00:03:45,280
round up refugees
who stray into the mountains,

88
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:47,319
herb farmers, traveling merchants,
anyone.

89
00:03:47,479 --> 00:03:49,759
Every so often they drive them
into the deep forest

90
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:52,439
- to be hunted and shot as prey.
- Move!

91
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,520
- And any young woman among them
- Hurry, keep up!

92
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:56,240
- ends up even worse.
- Hurry!

93
00:03:56,483 --> 00:03:57,637
- What are you gaping at? Move!
- Go!

94
00:03:58,163 --> 00:03:58,557
Hurry up!

95
00:03:58,577 --> 00:03:59,032
Move it!

96
00:04:00,219 --> 00:04:00,932
I'm talking to you!

97
00:04:01,479 --> 00:04:03,400
All right, this is far enough.

98
00:04:07,639 --> 00:04:09,319
General Du is merciful.

99
00:04:09,639 --> 00:04:11,960
He's willing to let you spies live.

100
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:14,280
- We're not spies!
- We're innocent!

101
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,039
- Silence!
- We're not spies!

102
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,680
Within 30 minutes,

103
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,040
you may run as far as you can.

104
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:20,519
Anyone who makes it out of this forest

105
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,160
can thank their lucky stars.

106
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:24,879
Those who don't
will live or die by fate.

107
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,560
Start the clock.

108
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:27,480
- Go!
- Run!

109
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,360
Begin!

110
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,199
Ye!

111
00:04:29,199 --> 00:04:30,079
Run!

112
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,879
That girl's mine after this.

113
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:35,680
Oh, Yuya.

114
00:04:37,079 --> 00:04:40,399
That strength-draining powder is nasty,
isn't it?

115
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,800
Where's Feng Weiyue?

116
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,360
You should worry about

117
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,040
yourself first.

118
00:04:49,879 --> 00:04:52,040
But I don't mind telling you.

119
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,040
By now

120
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:58,519
she's probably just a cheap whore,
cursed by everyone.

121
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,240
Huh?

122
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:08,560
She was just here.

123
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,839
Where did she go?

124
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,319
Boss, get out of the mountains, quick!

125
00:05:23,519 --> 00:05:25,040
Once I've dealt with
those thug soldiers,

126
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:26,519
I'll gather the refugees.

127
00:05:26,519 --> 00:05:27,279
Alright.

128
00:05:27,279 --> 00:05:29,040
I'll go find Yan Qi's troops

129
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,000
and come back for you.

130
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,120
Don't worry, boss.

131
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:33,040
I'm saving these people, no matter what.

132
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,759
Stay safe.

133
00:05:34,759 --> 00:05:35,519
Go on, now.

134
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:36,360
I'm off.

135
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:40,240
- Madam!
- Madam!

136
00:05:41,639 --> 00:05:42,439
Madam Feng,

137
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,319
something unexpected happened.

138
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,839
An old man among the refugees
started killing people.

139
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:46,920
And...

140
00:05:47,279 --> 00:05:50,279
And the woman you dealt with last night
has escaped the forest.

141
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,439
What?

142
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,519
Where did that wretch run off to?

143
00:05:53,519 --> 00:05:54,319
Take me to search for her!

144
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,399
Give me that.

145
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,959
Split up. After her!

146
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:27,519
Time to die, Feng Weiyue!

147
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,639
Princess Consort, forgive me.

148
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:14,759
We arrived too late.

149
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:20,560
Quick, go save the people and Mo Yuya.

150
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:21,519
Understood.

151
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:28,079
Coming all this way
from the Imperial City to Yunlu City,

152
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:31,160
you really didn't disappoint me, Yuya.

153
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,279
Mo Xuanji,

154
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,519
do you know what you're doing?

155
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:42,560
You're the Grand Princess of Yinbei,

156
00:07:42,879 --> 00:07:46,120
yet at court you build factions
and abuse your power,

157
00:07:46,759 --> 00:07:49,399
and here in Yunlu City
you keep a private army.

158
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,600
Do you mean

159
00:07:51,959 --> 00:07:54,199
to replace the reigning Emperor

160
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:56,079
and seize the throne?

161
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:04,839
I am the legitimate daughter
of the late Emperor.

162
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:08,240
My statecraft is a match for any man's.

163
00:08:08,519 --> 00:08:11,879
From childhood, I read memorials
at my father's side

164
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:12,839
and handled affairs of state.

165
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:16,160
I am the one most fit
to rule this realm.

166
00:08:18,639 --> 00:08:21,839
The people of Yinbei
live in peace and plenty.

167
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:24,279
The borders are quiet.

168
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,680
So who sits on the throne

169
00:08:26,759 --> 00:08:27,720
makes no difference.

170
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,560
If it makes no difference,

171
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:32,559
why shouldn't I take that seat?

172
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:35,879
I could govern Yinbei just as well.

173
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:38,480
But because I am a woman,

174
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:42,679
the late Emperor handed the throne to
his useless, spineless grandson

175
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:44,279
rather than to me!

176
00:08:44,519 --> 00:08:45,559
Keeping a private army

177
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:47,159
and letting it butcher our people...

178
00:08:47,879 --> 00:08:49,360
Is this what you call

179
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,000
good governance?

180
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,919
Great causes

181
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:03,639
always demand sacrifices.

182
00:09:05,039 --> 00:09:07,320
I thank them for it.

183
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,639
Mo Yuya,

184
00:09:11,639 --> 00:09:15,360
when Yan Qi found that lead
on the private army,

185
00:09:15,639 --> 00:09:17,320
you must have been overjoyed.

186
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:23,039
Do you know that after I lost
my account book on the waterway,

187
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,080
I left that lead for you on purpose?

188
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,120
The reason you're here

189
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:31,120
is that you fell for my trap.

190
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:33,919
Haha!

191
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:40,600
Today, in these deep mountains,

192
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:45,200
your bones will lie unclaimed

193
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:48,519
and your corpse rot
for a thousand years.

194
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,279
Mo Xuanji,

195
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:03,600
Have you considered that,
by coming all the way here,

196
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:07,360
I was turning your scheme against you?

197
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:10,480
Your Highness!

198
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:11,679
Mo Yuya!

199
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:14,840
Are you all right?

200
00:10:15,799 --> 00:10:16,320
I'm fine.

201
00:10:17,759 --> 00:10:18,279
It's over now.

202
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,919
Your... Your Majesty?

203
00:10:28,679 --> 00:10:29,480
Your Majesty,

204
00:10:30,159 --> 00:10:31,080
now do you believe me?

205
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:34,200
Mo Xuanji has long plotted treason.

206
00:10:36,279 --> 00:10:37,480
Aunt Xuanji,

207
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,360
you always told me

208
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:43,039
I would be the wisest ruler
Yinbei ever had.

209
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:46,039
Your Majesty,
it's not what it looks like.

210
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,919
It's Mo Yuya's plot.

211
00:10:47,919 --> 00:10:49,600
Mo Yuya is framing me!

212
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:52,000
This whole city is full
of Mo Yuya's troops!

213
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:54,360
You won't admit it until it's too late.

214
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:58,559
Then let me make it clear
to His Majesty.

215
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:01,840
I am the legitimate daughter
of the late Emperor.

216
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:04,879
My statecraft is a match for any man's.

217
00:11:05,279 --> 00:11:08,399
I am the one most fit
to rule this realm.

218
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,600
Impossible. That's impossible.

219
00:11:11,639 --> 00:11:13,120
It's all fake, Your Majesty.

220
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:13,879
It's fake.

221
00:11:13,879 --> 00:11:15,159
It's sorcery!

222
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,080
Don't move.

223
00:11:19,679 --> 00:11:20,399
Take them all away.

224
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:23,799
Your Majesty! Have mercy, Your Majesty!

225
00:11:24,039 --> 00:11:25,639
Spare me, Your Majesty!

226
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:47,840
Mo Yuya,

227
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:50,039
look, a rainbow.

228
00:12:07,159 --> 00:12:09,480
Remember the last time
I left the capital to find the wormhole?

229
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,200
The day you came looking for me,

230
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:13,559
there was a rainbow too.

231
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:21,159
When you rode toward me that day,

232
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:22,480
you looked so dashing.

233
00:12:40,679 --> 00:12:41,559
Back then, I thought,

234
00:12:42,399 --> 00:12:44,039
what if you were like that rainbow,

235
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,360
gone in a flash,

236
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:49,000
just a passing figure in my life?

237
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:50,399
Thankfully,

238
00:12:50,919 --> 00:12:51,960
that's not how it turned out.

239
00:12:52,919 --> 00:12:56,120
Mo Yuya, when I ran out
of the mountains,

240
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,440
when I thought I couldn't hold on,

241
00:13:00,399 --> 00:13:01,879
the only person I wanted to see

242
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:03,600
was you.

243
00:13:18,500 --> 00:13:20,833
♪Maybe the hardest riddle to solve♪

244
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:23,639
Then stay.

245
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:26,919
Stay and watch over this land with me.
What do you say?

246
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:32,679
Kugu Ridge was just a legend.
The wormhole was just a trick.

247
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,720
I can't go back now, that's for sure.

248
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,240
So what else can I do?

249
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:38,240
Since you've asked so warmly, Mo Yuya,

250
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,799
how could I refuse?

251
00:13:39,799 --> 00:13:41,320
♪I believe we can be together♪

252
00:13:42,159 --> 00:13:47,080
Then I'll have you in a phoenix crown
and bridal robes, and marry you again.

253
00:13:49,588 --> 00:13:51,880
♪Say I'm out of my mind♪

254
00:13:52,628 --> 00:13:55,240
♪Say I'm obsessed♪

255
00:13:56,022 --> 00:14:00,440
♪You set me burning with love♪

256
00:14:00,634 --> 00:14:03,360
♪Our eyes entwined in this moment♪

257
00:14:03,598 --> 00:14:06,520
♪Who can weigh right from wrong?♪

258
00:14:06,984 --> 00:14:08,920
♪Blame it on all you gave♪

259
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:12,800
♪I break through all cause and effect♪

260
00:14:13,338 --> 00:14:16,000
♪Even if I leap into the fire♪

261
00:14:16,521 --> 00:14:18,880
♪Bound in the shackles of love♪

262
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:19,932
(Wedding)

263
00:14:19,932 --> 00:14:22,680
♪If only you say it♪

264
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:25,799
The auspicious hour has come.
Please welcome the officiant.

265
00:14:25,799 --> 00:14:28,432
(Wedding)

266
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:49,240
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

267
00:14:49,447 --> 00:14:51,760
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

268
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:55,800
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

269
00:14:56,287 --> 00:14:58,607
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

270
00:14:59,593 --> 00:15:02,600
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

271
00:15:03,167 --> 00:15:05,400
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

272
00:15:06,533 --> 00:15:11,013
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

273
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:16,280
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

274
00:15:16,913 --> 00:15:19,600
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

275
00:15:20,774 --> 00:15:23,400
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

276
00:15:23,753 --> 00:15:25,960
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

277
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:30,120
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

278
00:15:30,473 --> 00:15:32,840
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

279
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:34,760
♪This love remains unchanged♪

280
00:15:34,760 --> 00:15:38,280
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

281
00:15:40,013 --> 00:15:42,453
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

282
00:15:42,560 --> 00:15:46,520
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

283
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:49,320
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

284
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:51,220
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

285
00:15:51,220 --> 00:15:52,960
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

286
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:56,320
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

287
00:15:56,320 --> 00:16:00,640
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

288
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:03,000
♪I don't regret that vow♪

289
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:06,480
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
